{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":79,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祈求上帝拯救"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["亞薩的詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人侵佔你的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污你的聖殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使耶路撒冷淪為廢墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們把你僕人的屍體餵飛鳥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你忠心子民的屍體給野獸吃，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使耶路撒冷周圍血流成河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屍體無人埋葬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們成了鄰國羞辱的對象，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"周圍的人都嗤笑、譏諷我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你向我們發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到何時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道要到永遠嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的怒火要燒到何時呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你把烈怒撒向那些不承認你的列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒向那些不求告你的列國。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們吞噬了雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀了他的家園。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要向我們追討我們祖先的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你快快地憐憫我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們落入絕望中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救我們的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你為了自己榮耀的名而幫助我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你名的緣故拯救我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赦免我們的罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何讓列邦說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「他們的上帝在哪裡？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你讓我們親眼看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也讓列邦都知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為自己被害的子民伸冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂聽被囚之人的哀歎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你用大能的臂膀留住死囚的性命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，我們的鄰邦羞辱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你以七倍的羞辱來報應他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，你的子民，你草場上的羊必永遠稱謝你，世代稱頌你。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/79.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/80.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/78.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}